    <part id="ai-engineering">
      <title>AI Engineering is Growing Up</title>
      <slide id="ai-power">
        <title>A Trillion Operations for 2 + 3?</title>
        <img src="ai-hammer.png" title="Maslow's AI Hammer" style="float: right ; height : 70% ; margin : 0% 4% 4% 4% ; "/>
        <table style="border-collapse: collapse ; border: 2px solid #000000 ;">
          <tr>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ;"></th>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ;">Machine Instructions</th>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ;">AI</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Elapsed time</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">~1 nanosecond</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">~0.1–2 seconds</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Computation</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">~1 integer operation</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">~10<sup>11</sup>–10<sup>13</sup> arithmetic operations</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Energy</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">~10–100 picojoules</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">~10–1,000 joules</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <ul>
          <li>Billion times slower</li>
          <li>Trillion times more computation</li>
          <li>10<sup>12</sup>–10<sup>14</sup> times more energy</li>
          <li>And no guarantee it got the answer right</li>
        </ul>
      </slide>
      <slide id="pitch-vs-reality">
        <title>The Benevolent AI Superintelligence?</title>
        <table style="border-collapse: collapse ; border: 2px solid #000000 ; width : 90% ; margin : 0 5% ;">
          <tr>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ; width : 50% ;">The Vision</th>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ; width : 50% ;">Immediate Reality</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; vertical-align : top ;">
              <ul>
                <li>One agent, one model, all tasks</li>
                <li>Always gets the right answer</li>
                <li>Autonomous, self-directing</li>
                <li>No human engineering required</li>
                <li><q>Just describe what you want</q> and trust us</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; vertical-align : top ;">
              <ul>
                <li>Same prompt returns different answers</li>
                <li>Behavior drift on model updates</li>
                <li>Most business logic is deterministic</li>
                <li>AI earns its keep on judgment tasks</li>
                <li>Reliability = clean cuts between the two</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </slide>
      <slide id="design-vs-runtime">
        <title>AI at Design Time! AI at Runtime?</title>
        <table style="border-collapse: collapse ; border: 2px solid #000000 ; width : 90% ; margin : 0 5% ;">
          <tr>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ; width : 50% ;">AI at Design Time</th>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ; width : 50% ;">AI at Runtime</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; vertical-align : top ;">
              <ul>
                <li>Recognizes patterns</li>
                <li>Writes the code</li>
                <li>You review and ship</li>
                <li>Runs deterministically forever after</li>
                <li>Use it aggressively</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; vertical-align : top ;">
              <ul>
                <li>The only tool for genuine judgment tasks</li>
                <li>The only tool for unstructured input at scale</li>
                <li>Real value where no non-AI option exists</li>
                <li>Costly per call — budget deliberately</li>
                <li>Handle with care</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </slide>
